{
  "id": "section-monster-descriptions",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "section-monster-descriptions:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Monster Descriptions\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,592,613]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monster-descriptions:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Monsters have the following\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,613,641]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monster-descriptions:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "information in their profiles:\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,641,672]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monster-descriptions:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Number encountered, like d6 or\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,672,703]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monster-descriptions:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "d6+3; if number is not shown, you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,703,737]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monster-descriptions:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "meet just ONE creature.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,737,761]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monster-descriptions:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Name: the name of the creature,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,761,793]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monster-descriptions:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "such as “zombie squirrel horde” or\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,793,828]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monster-descriptions:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“flaming skeletons”.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,828,849]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monster-descriptions:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Level: Abbreviated as L, this is the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,849,886]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monster-descriptions:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "target number that you must roll to\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,886,922]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monster-descriptions:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "perform Attack or Defense rolls\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,922,954]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monster-descriptions:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "against that creature. If a monster\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,954,990]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monster-descriptions:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "is L4, it means you will hit the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,990,1023]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monster-descriptions:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "monster on a 4+ on your Attack roll\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,1023,1059]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monster-descriptions:p0015",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "and will successfully defend against\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,1059,1096]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monster-descriptions:p0016",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "that monster with a Defense roll of\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,1096,1132]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monster-descriptions:p0017",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "4+.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,1132,1136]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monster-descriptions:p0018",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Life: The number of Life points that\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,1136,1173]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monster-descriptions:p0019",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the creature has.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,1173,1191]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monster-descriptions:p0020",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Damage: The number of Life\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,1191,1218]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monster-descriptions:p0021",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "points that the monster inflicts\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,1218,1251]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monster-descriptions:p0022",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "when you fail a Defense roll against\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,1251,1288]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monster-descriptions:p0023",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "it.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,1288,1292]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monster-descriptions:p0024",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Chance of Surprise if any. This is\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,1292,1327]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monster-descriptions:p0025",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "always expressed as a chance in 6,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,1327,1362]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monster-descriptions:p0026",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "such as 2 in 6, 3 in 6, etc. If no\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,1362,1397]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monster-descriptions:p0027",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "chance of surprise is shown, the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,1397,1430]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monster-descriptions:p0028",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "monster has no chance of\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,1430,1455]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monster-descriptions:p0029",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "surprising you and you act first.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,1455,1489]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monster-descriptions:p0030",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "The description then lists any\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,1489,1520]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monster-descriptions:p0031",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Special rules  that apply to that\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,1520,1554]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monster-descriptions:p0032",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "creature, such as effects of its\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,1554,1587]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monster-descriptions:p0033",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "attacks, Saves that you must\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,1587,1616]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monster-descriptions:p0034",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "perform upon seeing the creature\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,1616,1649]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monster-descriptions:p0035",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "or being hit by its attacks, chances\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,1649,1686]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monster-descriptions:p0036",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "to interact in other ways than\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,1686,1717]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monster-descriptions:p0037",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "combat, and so on.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,1717,1736]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monster-descriptions:p0038",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Loot: Any items or other rewards\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,1736,1769]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monster-descriptions:p0039",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you gain by defeating the creature.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,1769,1805]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monster-descriptions:p0040",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Sometimes it’s a specific item, and\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,1805,1841]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monster-descriptions:p0041",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "sometimes it’s  a random object or\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,1841,1876]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monster-descriptions:p0042",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "a variable quantity of Food or\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,1876,1907]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monster-descriptions:p0043",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "ammunition. If no Loot information\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,1907,1942]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monster-descriptions:p0044",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "is given, you gain nothing.",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,1942,1969]]"
    }
  ],
  "sourcePages": [
    35
  ]
}
